{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1466813-allegiance-overlap","id":1466813,"title":"Allegiance overlap","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-05T13:33:40-07:00","id":1466813,"title":"Allegiance overlap","content":"I actually really like the Allegiances available in the core book that exist in the modern day setting but I can't help but feel like there is some overlap. Like multiple &quot;spy&quot; agencies being the most notable. Anyone have some ideas how to further differentiate them? Here are some of my ideas.<br /> <br /> 9- The book already describes them as a possible SHIELD analogue but how does policing and regulating Enhanced individuals really differ from what NOER does? And if you envision them as more an espionage organization how do they differ from Alert Status 1? My solution is to interprete them as being involved with people making use of Inspired phenomena. So for example the classic evil corporation selling a zombie making virus would be their deal, or a guy threatening to use a death ray.<br /> <br /> NOER- They're more the Men in Black or SCP Foundation to 9's SHIELD but that's more a matter of flavor. For a functional difference I would say that NOER is more about dealing with Inspired phonomena in the wild. While 9 is in the middle east trying to stop someone from weaponizing ancient space vampires NOER is investigating reports of giant subterranean worms that have attacked a small and isolated desert community in the American west. There is probably still some jurisdictional issues when 9 and NOER are both dealing with Extraterrestrial events, though.<br /> <br /> Alert Status 1- They seem to be primarily concerned with mundane espionage but that seems a bit lacking. Sure there are other Allegiances devoted to working to solve mundane issues with their skills but fictional inspired espionage should be larger then life. So I figure Alert Status 1 should be focused on stopping exceptional individuals who use mundane means. The super hacker that holds America's infrastructure hostage. A billionaire CEO who has infiltrated a black ops American spy organization and is using a Talent analyst's skills to engineer hostilities so that he can sell weapons to everyone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27133-planguy","name":"Planguy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-05T14:57:51-07:00","id":1466821,"title":"","content":"They are all spy/investigation agencies, but they are based in different things and have different objectives.<br /> <br /> 9 is SHIELD, as you described, a organization with some connection to many governments but not really part of them.<br /> <br /> NOER is something like NSA, FBI and CIA (or KGB in the other side of the curtain).<br /> <br /> Alert Status 1 is Mission Impossible, a third part agency that works for companies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-05T20:09:54-07:00","id":1466861,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1466813-allegiance-overlap?p=1466821#post1466821\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They are all spy/investigation agencies, but they are based in different things and have different objectives.<br /> <br /> 9 is SHIELD, as you described, a organization with some connection to many governments but not really part of them.<br /> <br /> NOER is something like NSA, FBI and CIA (or KGB in the other side of the curtain).<br /> <br /> Alert Status 1 is Mission Impossible, a third part agency that works for companies.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a really good explanation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-06T03:41:45-07:00","id":1466923,"title":"","content":"Some overlap between the three is inevitable because they move in the same circles, and that's ok, conflict over jurisdiction can create opportunities for cool games. I think you and Mateus have given plenty of good ways to differentiate them. However, If I were to summarize my points, I would say that the main difference between 9 and Noer is that Noer is a <b>national agency</b> focused on containment first and foremost, and the main difference between 9 and alert status 1 is that alert status 1 main objective is <b>global politics stability</b>, not weird phenomena.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2964,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","user":"Firanai","date":". 11-06-2021, 05:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-09T19:09:26-08:00","id":1467315,"title":"","content":"My tweaks<br /> <br /> 9 is NATO + key-ally-investigation/control toward paranormal phenomena (mad science, powered individuals, dimensional events, etc). They are very much SHIELD or UNIT<br /> <br /> Alert Status 1 isn\u2019t backed by any government. It\u2019s more or less a conspiracy of intelligence agents from different often opposing countries (US and Russia, India and Pakistan, etc) who decided together than preventing war was more important than loyalty to their governments, and will coordinate together, often lying to their bosses, toward that end.<br /> <br /> NOER I use as a non-player group, as they\u2019re the agents of a specific government collecting and researching the type of phenomena that 9 is charged to protect the public from, with the goal of weaponization. If you\u2019re a Doctor Who fan, if 9 is UNIT, then NOER is Torchwood London when we first meet it on Doctor Who (not Torchwood Cardiff on the spin-off).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 11-10-2021, 12:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-09T23:53:29-08:00","id":1467329,"title":"","content":"I saw NOER as more akin to the SCP Foundation or the MIB. The style of play that would be focused on with them would be different then with 9 but they still have their place as a protagonist player faction. 9 is going to be trying to take down a group of super soldiers that is attempting to perform a coup in a small nation. NOER might be investigating a tunnel that you exit from the same place you enter from, or bigfoot, or some other cryptid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27133-planguy","name":"Planguy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-10T06:17:01-08:00","id":1467348,"title":"","content":"NOER is a intelligence service of US government, much like FBI and CIA, focused on the same subjects as SCP Fundation, but still a government agency. It would be more like the FBI in X Files and less like SCP.<br /> <br /> If one of the Allegiances works closer to SCP foundation it\u2019s 9, as it\u2019s international, not connected to any government but still with their authorization and working without notice from the general public.<br /> <br /> Sure you can read it different, there are no SCP Foundation in the list, but some are closer in idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-10T10:12:22-08:00","id":1467364,"title":"","content":"Another thing I want to point out. Even though the book doesn't say anything, in my head cannon I'm pretty sure that each member of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Group_of_Eight\" target=\"_blank\">group of eight</a> has an agency or department similar to NOER. After all, 9 is a global compromise not a (dare I say it?) directive <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> sometimes you want to keep the weird stuff to yourself just to make sure that the other guys doesn't have it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-10T13:41:21-08:00","id":1467377,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firanai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1466813-allegiance-overlap?p=1467364#post1467364\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Another thing I want to point out. Even though the book doesn't say anything, in my head cannon I'm pretty sure that each member of the <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Group_of_Eight&amp;quot;]group</a> of eight[/URL] has an agency or department similar to NOER. After all, 9 is a global compromise not a (dare I say it?) directive <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> sometimes you want to keep the weird stuff to yourself just to make sure that the other guys doesn't have it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I like that idea. <br /> <br /> On another subject, I think another reason why NOER and it's sister organizations would play different then 9 is their approach to oddities. 9 probably has living members who remember fighting against the last remnants of the Mars Empire. They are used to this stuff and treat it like an everyday thing. I imagine the average agent of 9 has an attitude like Phil Coulson. NOER I imagine treat inspired weirdness as a threat, or at least not something you take for granted. That's where the SCP Foundation attitude would come into play. I figure they would be more clinical with reports. So, 9 treats inspired phenomena as familiar and NOER treats it as unfamiliar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27133-planguy","name":"Planguy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-11T08:20:47-08:00","id":1467448,"title":"","content":"NOER always reminded me of the TV show Fringe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4270-literatzi","name":"literatzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4270_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-11T20:43:28-08:00","id":1467521,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>literatzi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1466813-allegiance-overlap?p=1467448#post1467448\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">NOER always reminded me of the TV show Fringe.</div> </div> </div> </div>OK... now I need to see someone make a character sheet for &quot;Walter&quot;. \ud83e\udd23","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26905-eternl-knight","name":"Eternl Knight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26905_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}